## Run it locally

```bash
pnpm install
{%- if 'api' in apps %}
docker compose up -d
cp apps/api/.env.example apps/api/.env
{%- if 'web' in apps %}
cp apps/web/.env.example apps/web/.env
{%- endif %}
{%- if 'mobile' in apps %}
cp apps/mobile/.env.example apps/mobile/.env
{%- endif %}
pnpm --filter ./apps/api prisma:migrate:dev
pnpm --filter ./apps/api db:seed
{%- endif %}
{%- for app in apps %}
pnpm dev:{{ app }}
{%- endfor %}
```
